      "id": "claim_812eac3297494651aab3fc2217cda1a0",
      "statement": "The Vue app communicates with the Ulabase service via HTTP endpoints, with the kit handling authentication and session management. The service is a managed backend that handles authentication, user management, permissions, and business rules.",
