    {
      "id": "claim_9317ed520d65469dad4ecfbf8a8a7337",
      "statement": "JSON Web Tokens (JWT) carry user information and are used for authentication. The service includes standard claims (sub, iat, exp, iss), user properties (profile, roles, teams), and consent claims (when enabled: latestConsents/tos, latestConsents/pp). These claims are configured in the service's auth-config.",
