    {
      "id": "claim_cbfda683cd654226a547dbb54d991270",
      "statement": "The service is configured declaratively from ulabase.setup.ts (base configuration) and ulabase.setup.consents.ts (consents gate configuration). These files implement an idempotent step/check/apply pattern where each step checks if the desired state exists and applies it only if missing.",
