    {
      "id": "claim_9db07aa878264bac94f563232acd4282",
      "statement": "Key architectural principles include server-side enforcement (all business rules happen on the service), client-side reaction (Vue app only reacts to HTTP status codes), declarative configuration (service configured from setup files), single source of truth (feature flags drive both client and server), idempotent setup (multiple runs produce same result), and no server code in repository (only client-side Vue code and setup files).",
      "evidence": [
